<section class="bg-base-100 py-12 md:py-16">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:max-w-5xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <%- include('../components/section_title', { text: 'Peer Review and Publication Ethics', level: "h2" }) %>
    </div>

    <article class="bg-secondary/10 p-4 border border-secondary/20 mb-8">
      <div class="bg-base-100 p-5 border-l-4 border-secondary">
        <p class="text-body text-base-content/90 leading-relaxed text-justify">All submitted full-length papers will undergo preliminary screening for scope, formatting, originality, and plagiarism. Papers found suitable will be assigned for peer review by subject experts. Acceptance for conference presentation does not guarantee publication. Only technically sound, original, and properly revised manuscripts will be recommended for further publication consideration.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-secondary/10 p-4 border border-secondary/20">
        <h3 class="text-h6 text-secondary font-montserrat font-bold mb-3">Originality and Plagiarism Policy</h3>
        <p class="text-body text-base-content/90 leading-relaxed text-justify bg-base-100 p-3 border border-base-200">Submitted manuscripts must be original and must not be under consideration elsewhere. All papers will be checked for plagiarism and similarity before review or publication recommendation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-secondary/10 p-4 border border-secondary/20">
        <h3 class="text-h6 text-secondary font-montserrat font-bold mb-3">Extended Journal Manuscripts</h3>
        <p class="text-body text-base-content/90 leading-relaxed text-justify bg-base-100 p-3 border border-base-200">For any extended journal manuscript developed from an AFTMME 2026 conference presentation, authors must ensure that the manuscript is not under consideration elsewhere, has not been published elsewhere, and is not included in any conference proceedings. Authors should clearly declare prior conference presentation where applicable and must provide substantial technical extension, additional analysis, improved validation, and appropriate copyright compliance according to the concerned journal or publisher policy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-secondary/10 p-4 border border-secondary/20">
        <h3 class="text-h6 text-secondary font-montserrat font-bold mb-3">Peer-Review Process</h3>
        <p class="text-body text-base-content/90 leading-relaxed text-justify bg-base-100 p-3 border border-base-200">Full-length papers will first be screened by the technical committee. Suitable papers will be sent to subject experts for peer review. Final acceptance will depend on reviewer recommendations, technical quality, originality, and relevance to the conference theme.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-secondary/10 p-4 border border-secondary/20">
        <h3 class="text-h6 text-secondary font-montserrat font-bold mb-3">Conflict of Interest Policy</h3>
        <p class="text-body text-base-content/90 leading-relaxed text-justify bg-base-100 p-3 border border-base-200">Authors, reviewers, and committee members should disclose any conflict of interest that may affect fair evaluation of the manuscript.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-secondary/10 p-4 border border-secondary/20">
        <h3 class="text-h6 text-secondary font-montserrat font-bold mb-3">Research Ethics</h3>
        <p class="text-body text-base-content/90 leading-relaxed text-justify bg-base-100 p-3 border border-base-200">Authors must ensure that their research follows accepted ethical standards. Studies involving human participants, survey data, or institutional data should include appropriate permissions where required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-secondary/10 p-4 border border-secondary/20">
        <h3 class="text-h6 text-secondary font-montserrat font-bold mb-3">AI-Tool Use Declaration</h3>
        <p class="text-body text-base-content/90 leading-relaxed text-justify bg-base-100 p-3 border border-base-200">Authors should clearly declare any use of AI tools in manuscript preparation. The authors remain fully responsible for the accuracy, originality, and integrity of the submitted work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-secondary/10 p-4 border border-secondary/20">
        <h3 class="text-h6 text-secondary font-montserrat font-bold mb-3">Copyright and License Agreement</h3>
        <p class="text-body text-base-content/90 leading-relaxed text-justify bg-base-100 p-3 border border-base-200">For selected papers recommended for publication, authors may be required to complete copyright or licence forms according to publisher policies.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-secondary/10 p-4 border border-secondary/20 md:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="text-h6 text-secondary font-montserrat font-bold mb-3">Publisher Formatting Compliance</h3>
        <p class="text-body text-base-content/90 leading-relaxed text-justify bg-base-100 p-3 border border-base-200">Authors must revise accepted papers according to the formatting, reference, and submission requirements of the concerned proceedings, journal, or publisher.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
